docs {
  # Gets the latest available version of an ActiveGate installer

  **Deprecated**

  Returns the configured ActiveGate target version for the tenant. If no target version is configured, the latest available version is returned. **Deprecation notice:** This endpoint is deprecated. Use the Fleet Management API endpoint `/platform/fleet-management/v1/activegate/installer/version`

  **Auth:** OAuth (inherited from collection)

  **Required OAuth scopes:** `environment-api:deployment:download`, `fleet-management:activegates:download`

  **API token scopes:** InstallerDownload
}
